CORE
main.cpp
--cpp11 --unwind 4 --no-unwinding-assertions
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ loop and break: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The elements constructed in place in the static backing array were never
destroyed.  --unwind 4 covers the three iterations.
